For each tree $T$, there exists a positive integer
$k''_T$ such that, if $G$ is a $k''_T$-edge-connected bipartite graph
and $2|E(T)|$ divides $|E(G)|$, then \(G\) admits a \hbox{\(T\)-decomposition.}
